This package builds Sniffnet for Ubuntu 26.04 (resolute), amd64.

The orig tarball contains the release tag selected by debian/changelog,
its locked vendored Cargo dependencies and an offline .cargo/config.toml.
Prepare it with resources/packaging/linux/deb-source/prepare.py from the
packaging repository. Build with dpkg-buildpackage -b -us -uc after installing
the dependencies in debian/control, including the versioned Rust/Cargo packages
from ppa:rust-toolchain/staging. Do not re-vendor during the package build.

debian/upstream-source.json records the upstream tag and commit.
debian/vendor-inventory.json and debian/vendor-notices.txt record the vendored
crates and their bundled notices. These files and debian/asset-notices.txt
are installed under /usr/share/doc/sniffnet/.
